translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_71875799:

    # mc "If you're competitive, I can't think of any sport that wouldn't bring that side out of you."
    mc "如果你有竞争意识，我想不到有什么运动能压得住你这股劲。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:721
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_30968848:

    # sa "Neither could she. But that's how I eventually ended up in the tabletop club."
    sa "她也一样。但就是这样，我最终加入了桌游社。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:723
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_93716f04:

    # mc "Is that like board games?"
    mc "这像桌游吗？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:725
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_ffcfcd87:

    # sa "It's that and much more."
    sa "那就是，还有更多。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:726
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_58e3c9e4:

    # sa "It was fun, it was competitive, and it was incredibly social."
    sa "挺好玩的，竞争性十足，而且特别社交。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:727
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_315de901:

    # sa "I made a lot of friends in that club and had a lot of fun."
    sa "我在那个社团交到了很多朋友，玩得很开心。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:729
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_11d7b57d:

    # mc "Did you manage to keep your temper when playing?"
    mc "你玩的时候能控制住脾气吗？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:731
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_347be277:

    # sa "Haha, nope. I won a lot because I always tried to cheat."
    sa "哈哈，没那回事。我赢了很多次，因为我总是想耍点小聪明。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:732
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_144ddd60:

    # sa "And I know my friends let it slide a few times, but when they didn't, I would sulk."
    sa "而且我知道我的朋友们有时候会睁一只眼闭一只眼，但要是他们真较真了，我就会闷闷不乐。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:733
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_fec1d213:

    # sa "But they always made it fun and managed to lighten my mood."
    sa "但他们总能让一切变得有趣，帮我缓解心情。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:735
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_b1fd107b:

    # mc "It sounds like you found your true hobby."
    mc "听起来你找到了真正热爱的事情。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:737
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_9ceeec0f:

    # sa "I already told you I'm not as devoted as you are. I didn't stick with it for too long."
    sa "我早就跟你说过了，我可没你那么投入。我没坚持太久就放弃了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:738
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_dc714556:

    # sa "Eventually, I stopped going, and the friends I made I'd meet outside of the club."
    sa "最后我就不去参加了，那些在俱乐部认识的朋友，我也是在外面碰到的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:739
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_85ea3a97:

    # sa "But yeah, it was a fun hobby for a while."
    sa "不过嘛，这玩意儿确实玩了一阵子挺开心的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:741
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_b68619ec:

    # mc "I don't know much about board games, just the usual dice games and that landlord game where you play as a shoe or something."
    mc "我对桌游了解不多，就玩些普通的骰子游戏，还有那个当鞋的角色扮演游戏。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:743
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_ad65adf8:

    # sa "That's something that annoys me when people talk about board games. They always mention the \"classics\" as if they are the best games."
    sa "这种事让我很烦，当人们谈论桌游时，总是把那些所谓的“经典”当成最好的游戏来吹捧。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:744
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_6b76cd12:

    # sa "Any true player would tell you they are the worst games and that there is another world of games to discover beyond them."
    sa "任何真正的玩家都会告诉你，那些都是最烂的游戏，还有另一个更精彩的游戏世界等着被发现。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:745
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_f11eb426:

    # sa "And I think, if people only did venture into that world, they'd love board games too."
    sa "而且我觉得，如果人们真的愿意去探索那个世界，他们也会爱上桌游的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:747
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_fb8e884c:

    # mc "Well, that settles it. You have to show me some. Do you have any games here?"
    mc "那好，这下就确定了。你得给我看看。你这儿有游戏吗？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:749
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_81c35f6e:

    # sa "No. Well, we probably have some, but they are the fucking classics. That wouldn't prove my point."
    sa "没有。嗯，我们可能有一些，但都是他妈的那些经典老游戏。这可不能证明我的观点。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:751
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_a3bde904:

    # sa "Heather? Do we have any good board games?"
    sa "Heather？我们有什么好玩的桌游吗？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:753
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_33fd801a:

    # he "Do those exist?"
    he "那些游戏还存在吗？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:755
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_a333d7f7:

    # sa "Case in point."
    sa "举个例子。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:757
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_8bc35413:

    # cam "We have that Dots game."
    cam "我们有那个点点游戏。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:759
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_542fe67f:

    # he "I wouldn't play that unless I was hammered or horny."
    he "我可不会为了玩那个游戏喝醉或者动了什么念头才去玩。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:761
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_c4d52911:

    # sa "Yeah, it's not fun and I don't think [name] would be good at it."
    sa "是啊，不好玩，而且我觉得[name]也不擅长。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:763
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_da03055a:

    # mc "Huh? I would beat all of you at Dots."
    mc "哼？我能在Dots上赢你们所有人。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:764
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_cdfefed8:

    # mc "What's Dots?"
    mc "什么是Dots？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:766
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_d09275c7:

    # he "Sage. Left foot on blue...or...left hand on green."
    he "Sage。左脚踩蓝色……或者……左手按绿色。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:768
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_58026575:

    # sa "Blue it is."
    sa "蓝的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:770
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_6fa03099:

    # sa "How's it going, [name]? You're looking shaky."
    sa "咋样？[name]你看起来有点不稳。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:772
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_02d2ac2f:

    # mc "You've been lucky with your options so far."
    mc "你到目前为止运气还不错。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:774
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_6f75b29e:

    # cam "Haha! We're not lucky. You were kinda stupid with yours."
    cam "哈哈！我们可不是运气好。你刚才那手可真够蠢的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:776
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_83db1a75:

    # sa "Yeah, it's a real amateur move, choosing to place a hand early on. Always pick a foot over a hand unless you're forced."
    sa "是啊，一开始就选手确实很业余。除非别无选择，否则永远优先选脚。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:779
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_c075f9a7:

    # mc "Yeah, but... I'm not complaining."
    mc "嗯，不过……我也没抱怨。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:781
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_f2ab1878:

    # mc "Live and learn."
    mc "活到老学到老。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:783
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_73e22673:

    # he "[name]. Right hand on blue, or left foot on blue."
    he "[name]右手按蓝色，或左脚踩蓝色。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:785
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_1f92f592:

    # mc "I'm not getting up from here, am I?"
    mc "我没法从这里起来了，对吧？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:786
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_6ab18f92:

    # sa "You could, but the odds are that you're screwed."
    sa "你也可以这么做，但你大概率是死定了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:788
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_cc715f89:

    # he "Cammy. Left foot on pink or right hand on green."
    he "卡米。左脚踩粉，或者右手指绿。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:790
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_50354d90:

    # cam "Feet, all the way."
    cam "脚，一路到底。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:792
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_b42dec25:

    # he "Sage. Right hand on green or left hand on yellow."
    he "Sage。右手按绿色，或者左手按黄色。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:794
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_3f997113:

    # sa "Oh no! Now it got hard. [name] covers all green, but yellow might make me lose my balance."
    sa "哎呀！现在变难了。[name]覆盖所有绿色，但黄色可能会让我失去平衡。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:795
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_88458051:

    # mc "I think it's about time you used your hands."
    mc "我觉得你该用点手了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:797
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_efe4057f:

    # sa "All right, there we go. This boxes you in more too, you know?"
    sa "好，这样就更把你困住了，你明白吧？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:799
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_4e8ec4b6:

    # mc "I've been down here for ages now. I've gotten comfortable."
    mc "我在这儿待了好久了，已经习惯了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:801
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_5c0e4b87:

    # he "[name]. Lucky skip! Remove a limb or stay put. What do you wanna do?"
    he "[name]幸运跳过了！移除一个肢体还是原地不动？你想怎么做？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:802
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_29d78580:

    # mc "If I remove something, I'll fall over. I'm gonna stay put."
    mc "我要是去掉什么，立马就倒下。我就不动了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:804
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_61024c30:

    # sa "I thought we were playing the game, not skipping turns."
    sa "我们本来是在玩游戏，不是跳过回合的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:806
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_a093d388:

    # mc "Mocking me won't work."
    mc "取笑我也没用。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:808
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_0236a581:

    # sa "*{i}Chicken noises{/i}*"
    sa "*{i}鸡叫声{/i}*"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:810
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_ca8a1dc6:

    # mc "It must be hard playing a game where you can't cheat."
    mc "这游戏连作弊都做不到，肯定挺难的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:812
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_c85dd541:

    # he "Cammy. Right hand on blue, or right hand on yellow."
    he "卡米。右手按蓝色，或者右手按黄色。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:814
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_bf323807:

    # cam "Such crappy choices. I'll go for yellow."
    cam "这种烂选择。我选黄色。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:816
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_1ba280d9:

    # mc "(Oh no...)"
    mc "（哦不……）"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:819
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_2ca34e22:

    # sa "How's it going there, shaky?"
    sa "怎么了，那边抖得像筛子？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:820
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_399387a0:

    # mc "I'm trying not to fall."
    mc "我努力不掉下去。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:821
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_c526ca1b:

    # sa "You probably shouldn't get a boner, either."
    sa "你最好也别勃起。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:827
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_1905e6d6:

    # mc "I'm making no promises."
    mc "我可没答应什么。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:830
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_70435b05:

    # mc "I'm focusing here, Sage."
    mc "我正专心呢，Sage。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:831
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_c8e0e5c5:

    # sa "Haha!"
    sa "哈哈哈！"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:833
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_070b0ebf:

    # he "You guys are a pizza and a six-pack short of a perfect date."
    he "你们俩差了披萨和一打啤酒，才凑成完美约会。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:835
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_09278816:

    # "Hahaha!"
    "哈哈哈！"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:836
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_11455b53:

    # mc "What?"
    mc "什么？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:837
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_0e062654:

    # sa "It's an inside joke."
    sa "这是个内部笑话。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:839
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_7bb9dfe8:

    # he "Sage. Lucky skip!"
    he "Sage，幸运跳过！"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:841
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_251f55d8:

    # sa "Yes! Much more comfortable. *{i}Phew{/i}*"
    sa "是！舒服多了。*{i}呼——{/i}*"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:843
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_78f34776:

    # he "And with that, we enter the final phase. There will be only one choice from now on and no more lucky skips."
    he "说完，我们正式进入最后阶段。从现在开始，只有一个选择，不会再有幸运跳过了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:845
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_7bc32c58:

    # sa "Now the game starts for real."
    sa "现在游戏真的开始了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:846
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_d28c4c13:

    # he "[name]. Right hand on pink."
    he "[name]右手放在粉红处。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:848
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_65f2ebca:

    # mc "It's already on pink."
    mc "它已经在粉上了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:849
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_5816d605:

    # sa "Then, you have to move it to another pink dot."
    sa "然后你得把它移到另一个粉色点上。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:850
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_7f710e6a:

    # mc "I can't see where another pink is!"
    mc "我看不到另一个粉色在哪里！"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:851
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_f4eb257d:

    # he "There is one right next to your hand, toward the pool."
    he "旁边池塘那边有个，就在你手边。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:853
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_523367fd:

    # mc "Here?"
    mc "这里？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:854
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_5e68ea2a:

    # he "Yes, you got it!"
    he "对，你搞对了！"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:855
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_5afac447:

    # sa "Heather, don't help him! That's cheating."
    sa "Heather，别帮他！那是作弊。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:856
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_c7f4fc39:

    # he "Cammy. Right foot on blue."
    he "卡米。右脚踩蓝色。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:858
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_66fdf3fc:

    # cam "That was a lucky one."
    cam "那下个可就靠运气了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:859
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_6ba4733d:

    # he "Sage. Right foot on pink."
    he "Sage。右脚踩粉色。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:861
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_98cb4d81:

    # sa "Ok, so I have to move it here, then. Hngn..."
    sa "好，那我得把它挪这儿。嗯嗯……"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:863
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_50832090:

    # cam "Haha! Was that a groan?"
    cam "哈哈哈！那是不是在呻吟？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:865
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_f7eb1782:

    # sa "*{i}Whispers{/i}* I've got the balance, but my legs are cramping up... Help me out here. [name] can't win."
    sa "*{i}耳语{/i}*我有平衡，但腿开始抽筋了……帮我一下。[name]输不了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:866
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_0ef53f0a:

    # sa "*{i}Whispers{/i}* Push down on him."
    sa "*{i}耳语{/i}*按他身上压下去。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:868
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_4ded64e5:

    # cam "*{i}Whispers{/i}* Are you sure?"
    cam "*{i}耳语{/i}*你确定吗？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:870
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_0ac18d2e:

    # sa "*{i}Whispers{/i}* Trust me. He'll lose focus in an instant."
    sa "*{i}耳语{/i}*相信我，他马上就会分心。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:872
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_f15b024a:

    # mc "Um... Cammy? What are you doing over there?"
    mc "嗯... 凯米？你那边在干嘛？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:874
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_65fd2a47:

    # cam "I'm struggling to keep my balance, [name]."
    cam "我在努力保持平衡[name]."

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:878
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_89af4ad7:

    # mc "It doesn't feel like it's that, but all right. Hngn..."
    mc "这感觉不太对，不过算了。嗯嗯..."

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:880
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_835fa339:

    # mc "Well, can you try to keep your balance...uh...higher up?"
    mc "嗯，你能不能试着把重心再抬高点？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:885
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_581ba1a8:

    # mc "Hngn... Hey!"
    mc "哼哼...嘿！"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:887
translate schinese ep10_sage_solo_label_13c3c72f:

