    sa "那你就不算是个工程师了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1281
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_ce11e463:

    # mc "It's just a title."
    mc "不过是个头衔。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1283
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_8da6215e:

    # sa "True, but those titles make a difference in the real world. You can negotiate way higher salaries with them."
    sa "确实，但这些头衔在现实世界里真的有差别。有了它们，你还能谈出更高的薪水。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1284
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_1b1cec9a:

    # sa "I have a Ph.D. friend who got a 25%% extra starting wage because of her title. She didn't even have any work experience in that field."
    sa "我有个博士朋友考了25分%%额外的起薪是因为她的头衔。她甚至在那个领域都没有任何工作经验。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1286
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_8b8ce262:

    # mc "She probably has to make up for the years of not getting paid while studying for it."
    mc "她大概得把读书那几年没赚到的钱补回来。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1288
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_8c4e0d52:

    # sa "Yeah, of course, but that wage scales in time if you're negotiating correctly."
    sa "当然，不过如果你谈判得当，工资水平会随着时间慢慢提升。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1290
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_df94b748:

    # sa "Sorry, I shouldn't talk about business on our date."
    sa "抱歉，我应该在约会时少谈些工作的事。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1292
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_7fb4582a:

    # mc "I don't mind. I think it's attractive that you're passionate about things."
    mc "我不介意。我觉得你对事情这么有热情挺吸引人的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1294
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_8b36990f:

    # sa "You do?"
    sa "你真的这么想？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1297
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_8b8f1efd:

    # mc "Yeah. I don't think it's that common with girls."
    mc "嗯，我觉得女生里这样的人还真不多。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1299
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_e1838812:

    # sa "To be passionate? Are you mental? Because you're not saying that guys are more passionate, are you?"
    sa "有激情？你是不是脑子进水了？因为你不是在说男生比女生更有激情，对吧？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1301
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_f067e16b:

    # mc "Not romantically passionate, but with hobbies, yeah. I think, in general, guys are way more passionate than girls and that some girls blend into each other."
    mc "不是那种浪漫的激情，但有爱好的话，是的。我觉得总的来说，男生比女生更热情，有些女生还互相混在一起分不清。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1303
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_64451eb6:

    # sa "Ok, you have to explain yourself now. I've learned enough from my Mom to know that this topic would trigger a lengthy discussion."
    sa "好啊，你现在就得解释清楚了。我从我妈那儿学到一点，就是这个话题肯定会引发一场漫长的讨论。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1305
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_b0f9b8bb:

    # mc "Oh, believe me. I would have liked to discuss this in her class, but I didn't get the chance to."
    mc "哦，信我，我本来想在她课上讨论这个，但没机会。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1307
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_2f077951:

    # sa "So, how do girls blend into each other?"
    sa "所以，女生们是怎么互相混在一起的？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1309
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_89871eb3:

    # mc "You don't have to look far to see it. You'd see it everywhere if you browse girls' profiles on Swyper or Rooster."
    mc "你不用找太远的地方看，只要在Swyper或者Rooster上随便翻翻就能看到。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1310
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_afbd2e8d:

    # mc "Under hobbies, they list the same things. Working out, listening to music, partying and being with friends and family."
    mc "在兴趣爱好里，她们列出的东西也是一样的。健身、听音乐、聚会，还有和朋友家人在一起。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1312
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_c6675c54:

    # sa "I would list those things, too. What's your point?"
    sa "我也会列这些。你到底想说什么？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1314
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_5857ecbf:

    # mc "Those are things that most people enjoy doing, barring gender. And that's what I mean when I say that they blend into each other."
    mc "这些事情大多数人都喜欢做，不管性别如何。这就是我刚才说她们互相融合的意思。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1315
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_dc76e01d:

    # mc "It's rare to find a girl who lists something different, like archery or mountain climbing."
    mc "很难找到一个女孩会列出像射箭或者登山这种不一样的爱好。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1316
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_cc14ad07:

    # mc "And it's not that I find girls boring because they don't, but I find girls like you extra attractive."
    mc "而且我并不是因为她们没这些兴趣就觉得无聊，而是像你这样有自己热情和特点的女孩特别吸引我。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1318
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_9167f83d:

    # sa "Because I like to yap about school and work?"
    sa "因为我想聊点学校和工作的八卦？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1320
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_129d9987:

    # mc "No, because you're passionate about something and it shows. It makes you unique and interesting."
    mc "不，因为你对某件事充满热情，而且表现出来了。这让你变得独特而有趣。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1322
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_d25b8cda:

    # sa "I'm unsure if I should feel flattered or insulted on behalf of all the girls you think are all alike."
    sa "我不确定该为所有你觉得都差不多的女生感到荣幸还是被冒犯。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1324
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_ce102290:

    # mc "*{i}Sigh{/i}* It wasn't an insult. You can be passionate about those other things too... I probably didn't explain it well enough."
    mc "*{i}叹气{/i}*这并不是在侮辱你。你也可以对那些其他事情充满热情……我可能没有解释清楚。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1326
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_dda4b6b8:

    # sa "Haha! I see your point, and I don't agree with everything you said. But you're avoiding the safe topics, and I like that a lot."
    sa "哈哈！我明白你的意思，我也不是完全同意你说的每句话。但你故意避开那些安全的话题，这点我很喜欢。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1327
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_da4c3e41:

    # sa "Mom would eat you alive in this conversation."
    sa "你妈在场的话，她会把你吃掉的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1330
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_a49acd2f:

    # mc "(In more ways than one.)"
    mc "（以多种方式。）"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1332
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_bf1e6864:

    # mc "Haha, I bet she would."
    mc "哈哈，我打赌她肯定不会放过你。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1334
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_f92adec7:

    # mc "Yeah. I like that you have goals and motivations in life."
    mc "是啊。我喜欢你对人生有目标、有动力。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1336
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_af7be38f:

    # mc "You're smart, determined and feel hungry to learn and grow as a person."
    mc "你聪明、有决心，而且渴望在做人方面不断学习和成长。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1337
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_f097a5aa:

    # mc "Sometimes I feel like I'm dating out of my league."
    mc "有时候我感觉我是在跟比我高一档的人约会。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1339
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_0f0ff273:

    # sa "Do you think I'm out of your league?"
    sa "你觉得我配不上你吗？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1341
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_c4e0a8a7:

    # mc "It's been pointed out to me that you are. I didn't think so at first, but the more I reflect on it... I believe others might be right about it."
    mc "有人跟我说过你这样。我一开始没这么想，但越想越觉得……也许别人说的没错。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1342
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_3aa33ef5:

    # mc "I mean, I'm a freshman who was a nobody when I came here and you're a senior sorority president."
    mc "我是大一新生，刚来这儿的时候连个屁都不是，而你是大四的姐妹会主席。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1344
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_24f97230:

    # mc "You're smart in a field I know nothing about and you're on your way to make plans for a future that seemingly can be anything you want."
    mc "你在我完全不懂的领域很聪明，而你正走在一条能决定自己未来任何可能性的路上。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1345
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_bf34075b:

    # mc "Whereas I know nothing about my future and dread to plan it..."
    mc "而我却对未来的方向一无所知，甚至害怕去规划它……"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1346
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_28795580:

    # mc "When I think about you like that, you feel out of my league. It's intimidating but also so damned attractive."
    mc "当我这么想你的时候，你反而让我觉得遥不可及。这很令人畏惧，但也他妈的超有吸引力。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1349
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_84b2e85e:

    # sa "Those are some high thoughts you have about me..."
    sa "你脑子里想的这些可真够高的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1350
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_85fc18a8:

    # sa "And you're not out of my league. That's stupid. Don't sell yourself short like that."
    sa "而且你根本没超出我的水平。那话说得蠢透了，别把自己看得那么低。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1352
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_7a91bea3:

    # sa "Because I look at you and I see things I want to be too. And you're younger than me and have already accomplished some of those things."
    sa "因为我看你的时候，我也看到自己渴望成为的那种人。而你比我年轻，已经实现了其中一些。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1353
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_d45f0a73:

    # sa "And that's something I find attractive about you."
    sa "而且这也是我被你吸引的地方。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1355
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_fa45f281:

    # mc "Thanks..."
    mc "谢谢..."

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1357
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_12cd5866:

    # sa "I told you I like when you're confident, but I also like that you allow yourself to feel insecure and vulnerable."
    sa "我告诉你我喜欢你自信的时候，但我也喜欢你允许自己感到不安全和脆弱的时候。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1359
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_47095bc0:

    # mc "Yeah, well, I'm only human..."
    mc "嗯，好吧，我也是人..."

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1362
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_e44359da:

    # sa "Shall we leave for the movies?"
    sa "我们去电影厅吧？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1364
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_f9fcb5d6:

    # mc "Yeah, let's."
    mc "嗯，走吧。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1375
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_66a79cda:

    # sa "Why do people watch movies on dates?"
    sa "为什么人们约会时要去看电影？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1376
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_850e8c41:

    # sa "Why spend the time being silent next to someone you wanna bang?"
    sa "为什么花时间跟想上的人保持沉默？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1378
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_552e8429:

    # mc "Haha. That's a good question."
    mc "哈哈，这问题问得好。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1379
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_96b082c4:

    # mc "Maybe they want to see the movie and be on a date too? Even if the date sucks, they still get a movie out of it."
    mc "也许他们既想看电影，又想约会？就算约会很无聊，至少还能看场电影。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1381
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_33fd1320:

    # sa "To me, a movie is something you watch with your friends when you don't feel like talking or doing something else."
    sa "对我来说，电影就是和朋友一起看的，当你不想说话或者不想做别的事情的时候。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1383
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_02f57de0:

    # mc "I only suggested it because I struggled to come up with something better."
    mc "我只建议这么做的原因是因为我实在想不出更好的主意了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1385
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_993db4bf:

    # sa "Oh, it's fine."
    sa "哦，这挺好的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1387
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_1aa3caa4:

    # mc "I'm having a great time."
    mc "我玩得很开心。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1389
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_9290d6df:

    # sa "To be clear, I didn't say it sucks being here with you. I was just thinking about the stupid things people do on dates."
    sa "说白了，我也没说和你待在这儿有多糟糕。我只是在想，人们在约会时干那些傻事罢了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1391
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_286b5991:

    # mc "Honestly, I'd much rather spend the night talking with you than watching a movie."
    mc "说实话，我宁愿整晚和你聊天，也不愿看什么电影。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1392
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_46c9a80c:

    # mc "But at least I get to sit close to you."
    mc "但至少我能挨着你坐。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1399
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_f50178c3:

    # mc "When did this night stop feeling weird to you?"
    mc "这晚什么时候开始不觉得奇怪了？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1401
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_e8140a46:

    # sa "I think it was when we started talking like we always do. It made me feel comfortable again."
    sa "我想应该是当我们开始像平时那样聊天的时候。那让我感觉又舒服起来了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1402
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_00ebc221:

    # sa "It still feels different than usual but in a good way."
    sa "它还是和平时不一样，但感觉是种好得不一样的不一样。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1404
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_7b471f6f:

    # mc "Good."
    mc "好。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1406
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_d2b25179:

    # sa "I'm happy we did this."
    sa "我很高兴我们做了这件事。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1408
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_88449bb2:

    # mc "Me too. I've felt comfortable around you too."
    mc "我也是。我在你身边也觉得很自在。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1410
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_7b35fd90:

    # sa "You're not scared of me now, are you?"
    sa "你现在不害怕我了吧？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1412
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_350b7073:

    # mc "Haha, no."
    mc "哈哈，没那回事。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1414
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_f1386176:

    # sa "I take it you're not holding back on any questions you're scared to ask me."
    sa "我猜你没打算藏起那些不敢问我问题。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1416
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_68cb2b85:

    # mc "Not tonight."
    mc "不今晚了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1418
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_de837ae3:

    # sa "Good... You feel relaxed. I like that."
    sa "好……你感觉放松了。我喜欢这样。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1422
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_db2ffca3:

    # sa "*{i}Smack{/i}*"
    sa "*{i}亲吻{/i}*"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1426
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_b0601a88:

    # mc "Do you want some of my popcorn?"
    mc "你要来点我的爆米花吗？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1428
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_14b705b5:

    # sa "No, thanks. I've got my soda."
    sa "不，谢谢。我有我的汽水。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1430
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_4716877f:

    # mc "I thought you weren't having any tonight."
    mc "我以为你今晚不打算搞了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1432
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_b53b7cd9:

    # sa "I wasn't. But since we were doing the whole classic date and all, I figured I wouldn't sleep with you tonight."
    sa "我本来是不想的。但既然我们正做着经典的约会，我就想今晚别跟你上床了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1434
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_befb336a:

    # mc "I'm missing out on sex because of the date, huh?"
    mc "我因为约会错过了性，是吧？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1436
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_8b1f474e:

    # mc "It's ok with me. I wanted to go out on a date with you. It wasn't for sex to begin with."
    mc "没关系，我想和你约会。一开始就不打算为了性。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1438
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_10855b8b:

    # sa "Yes, that's what I realized. And I'm fine with it."
    sa "是的，我就是这么想的。我没什么不开心的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1440
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_7cd4853a:

    # sa "Although..."
    sa "虽然..."

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1442
translate schinese ep10_sage_date2_label_dc154e46:

    # mc "Although, what?"
    mc "虽然，什么？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1463
translate schinese ep10_sage_lewd_label_4769cbf3:

    # sa "I've thought of ways to surprise you."
    sa "我想出了几种方式来让你惊喜。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1465
translate schinese ep10_sage_lewd_label_a0e3601b:

    # mc "Surprise me with what?"
    mc "给我来点惊喜吧？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1467
translate schinese ep10_sage_lewd_label_6e1d3607:

    # sa "There's this thing I realized I'd like to try tonight...but I don't want to ruin our date with it."
    sa "我今天晚上想尝试点什么……不过我不想用这个来破坏我们的约会。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_sage_branch.rpy:1472
translate schinese ep10_sage_lewd_label_ba88452e:

